ALVA — Fluid Movement, Combat Feel & Combo Rework

Objective

Rework ALVA’s movement and combat game-feel so controlling #0001 feels substantially smoother, faster to respond, more expressive, and more satisfying, using MultiVersus as a feel reference, NOT as a mechanics specification.

Do not turn ALVA into MultiVersus.

Do not copy MultiVersus’s combat systems.

Do not introduce mechanics simply because MultiVersus has them.

Instead, study what makes movement and attacks in a polished platform fighter feel:

* responsive
* smooth
* controllable
* momentum-driven
* easy to redirect
* satisfying on hit
* easy to chain intentionally
* forgiving enough for players to create combos
* expressive without becoming uncontrollable

Then achieve those qualities using ALVA’s existing mechanics and abilities.

The final game must still unmistakably be ALVA.

⸻

